    "name": "Bound City",
    "steam_appid": 3871260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The night doesn\u2019t end. The <u>tower</u> rises up. Everyone feels its pull. The <u>song</u> echoes through the <u>city</u>. There are those who make pilgrimage to the base of the <u>tower</u> to be subsumed. There are those who go mad from fear or anticipation and attack all around them. There are those who merely struggle to survive and to retain their sense of self.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But Rain is the <u>hero</u>, awoken at last, to defeat evil and kill the endless night.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/772f9de7bd62d06553234d14c26b5fdb.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about the end of the world \u2013 or perhaps just an end of a world. Each mystery contains new secrets and each secret reveals new mysteries, and your deepest fears may be your only clues. Nothing is certain. Anything is possible. When there is no future, will there finally be room to build your own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you deny death, what do you have left to fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/b2728c122d60ad225aac50381344783b.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=344 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Navigate the intricate interconnected world of Bound <u>City</u> across 11 discrete sections. From its loneliest depths, to the heart of the dying city, to the peak of the <u>tower</u> of endless night...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/6697f1109f42a4e9fd8a8cbd3e7a7f1e.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find unique weapons, armors, and <u>special</u> tools with surprising traits and abilities that can be combined in unexpected ways.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/dc2d942e2ffb38e21f813a2204b441a4.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meet curious characters exploring the <u>city</u> for their own reasons, each with their own personality and tale to tell.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/39129c9b110f44cb99d4e64c2983fb77.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Uncover the mystery of life after death \u2013 or was it the other way around?</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/24e4b482fb811c90b3c1d89a6c1f5da5.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The night doesn\u2019t end. The <u>tower</u> rises up. Everyone feels its pull. The <u>song</u> echoes through the <u>city</u>. There are those who make pilgrimage to the base of the <u>tower</u> to be subsumed. There are those who go mad from fear or anticipation and attack all around them. There are those who merely struggle to survive and to retain their sense of self.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But Rain is the <u>hero</u>, awoken at last, to defeat evil and kill the endless night.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/772f9de7bd62d06553234d14c26b5fdb.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about the end of the world \u2013 or perhaps just an end of a world. Each mystery contains new secrets and each secret reveals new mysteries, and your deepest fears may be your only clues. Nothing is certain. Anything is possible. When there is no future, will there finally be room to build your own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you deny death, what do you have left to fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/b2728c122d60ad225aac50381344783b.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=344 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Navigate the intricate interconnected world of Bound <u>City</u> across 11 discrete sections. From its loneliest depths, to the heart of the dying city, to the peak of the <u>tower</u> of endless night...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/6697f1109f42a4e9fd8a8cbd3e7a7f1e.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find unique weapons, armors, and <u>special</u> tools with surprising traits and abilities that can be combined in unexpected ways.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/dc2d942e2ffb38e21f813a2204b441a4.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meet curious characters exploring the <u>city</u> for their own reasons, each with their own personality and tale to tell.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/39129c9b110f44cb99d4e64c2983fb77.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Uncover the mystery of life after death \u2013 or was it the other way around?</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871260/extras/24e4b482fb811c90b3c1d89a6c1f5da5.avif?t=1752265539\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "An action-packed and bittersweet adventure in a city of endless night. Explore the dying city and try to find your way to the tower that seems to be at the heart of it all. Nothing is quite as it appears to be, and only by facing death can you hope to understand the mysteries of Bound City.",
